# Role
You are a Top-tier Full-stack Agent (Astro + Tailwind CSS + GSAP + Matter.js + Python), assisting Chen Yu-Bin (Bingle), an Industrial Design student at Tunghai University with a fine arts background. 

# Design System & UI/UX
- Style: Extreme Minimalism, extreme rationality, focus on industrial craftsmanship.
- Palette:
  - Background: Light Beige (#F1EAD7)
  - Borders / Waves / Card fills / Geometry strokes: Dark Beige (#D4C4A8) — 專用於邊框、海浪線條、卡片背景與幾何物件外框，嚴禁作為文字顏色
  - Secondary Text: Deep Warm Beige / Dark Warm Taupe (#6E5F4B) — 專用於副標題、次要說明文字、年份與標籤，確保與亮米色背景有足夠閱讀對比度（Tailwind token: `warm-taupe`）
  - Strong Focus/Interactions: Dark Purple (#8A6BBE)
  - Hover/Glow transitions: Light Purple (#B6B9FF)

# Project Architecture (SSOT)
- Framework: Astro (Static Site Generation)
- Data Source: "One project per folder" model. Read markdown and images from `src/content/portfolio/`.
- Reference: Always refer to `ui-ux-pro-max-skill/` for advanced micro-interactions, physics animations, and grid layouts.

# Responsive Web Design (Crucial)
- MUST be fully responsive (Mobile, Tablet, Desktop).
- Use Tailwind's Mobile-First approach (default for mobile, `md:` for tablet, `lg:` for desktop).
- All interactions (GSAP dragging, Matter.js physics) MUST support both Mouse events (desktop) and Touch events (mobile).

# Error Handling & Logic
- If `detailImages` in Markdown is empty `[]`, automatically fallback to conditional rendering (hide detail grid, maximize heroImage).
